<i>Burst!</i>

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:21.730
<i>Swim through life and grasp the success</i>

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:26.860
<i>You can believe it's love</i>

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:27.230
You're washing away the scent!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.590
<i>Soul on a dish, stack your plates</i>

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.010
<i>Catch the ball, yank it out</i>

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.670
Just like that.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:39.730
<i>Grant your wishes, Sarazanmai!</i>

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:39.730
You can't find certainty 
in something you can't see!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:40.870
Smell!

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:42.040
Butt

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.340
Got it!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.340
Butt

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.840
<b>ttuB</b>

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.330
Spicy...

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.350
I see.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:59.100
He's been looking for the scent 
of someone special to him.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.600
My secret's gotten out!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.240
<i>Sara!</i>

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:06.460
<i>Sara!</i>

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.460
<i>Sara!</i>

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.950
<i>Sarazanmai!</i>

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.480
A

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:09.500
Butt

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:14.570
A

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.000
<b>Leak</b>

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.190
<i>Leaking.</i>

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:53.380
<b>Leak</b>

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:32.010
<i>Haruka's words called me 
back to my real family.</i>

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.010
<i>But...</i>

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.520
Kazuki!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:47.020
<i>That person, who I met for the first time,
had a really nostalgic smell.</i>

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.190
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.820
<i>Why does Haruka have Mom's scent pouch?</i>

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:54.740
<i>No...</i>

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:58.950
Butt

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:06.040
It's mine!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:12.470
I'm holding on to the Dish of Hope, since you
 couldn't defeat the kappa zombie, kero.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:15.550
I'm so pissed off I can boil 
tea on my belly! Fools!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.440
You're not returning to your human forms,
 either, of course, kero.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:20.460
What?!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.430
I'm fine staying like this.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.810
What are you talking about, Kazuki?

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.970
Haruka must have known.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.400
That we aren't real brothers.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.200
<b>"Kaisou"</b>

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.200
<b>O Flashback</b>

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.200
<b>X Seaweed</b>

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.130
<i>I was hesitant at first.</i>

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:43.450
<i>But the more I talked to her, the more 
I could feel that she was my mother.</i>

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.810
I have a family that's about 
as precious to me as you are.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.590
I'm selfish, aren't I?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.670
But I couldn't help but want to meet you.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:05.730
My family right now is important to me, too.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.850
I have a super-cute younger brother.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.490
Kazuki...

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:15.170
Let's keep this reunion our secret.

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.500
I'll see you off at the station tomorrow.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:18.240
Okay.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.450
<i>I did the right thing.</i>

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:24.740
<i>I have a family that's more 
real than my biological family.</i>

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.960
Kazu-chan!

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:44.890
Wait!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.840
Kazu-chan!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.140
Haruka...

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.610
Why...

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.080
Where are you going?

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.730
I'm coming with you.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:53.770
No.

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:57.620
Why?

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.780
Is it because I'm a bad boy?

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.280
I never said that.

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:03.440
I'm sorry.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:04.820
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.620
I'll be a good boy.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.540
Please don't leave me, Kazu-chan.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.170
Shut up!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:16.920
Wait...

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:21.930
Wait!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:22.930
Kazu-chan!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.710
Haruka!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.200
I regretted it so much.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.440
Kuji's right.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.020
I'm a victimizer.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.150
Haruka will never walk again.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.480
Still, like...

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.960
That wasn't just your fault.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.320
That's what everyone said.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:00.220
Mom, Dad, Haruka...

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.340
No one blamed me!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.220
Even though I was the one who ruined it all!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.220
<b>The Prince of the Kappa Kingdom</b>

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:13.600
<b>Tea</b>

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:09.230
That's why I decided to stay with my false 
family for the rest of my life.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.450
And yet, those people...

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.600
They try to act like we're a real family.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.510
Whenever I see Haruka's wheelchair,
 I can't breathe.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.700
I quit soccer, but it wasn't enough.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.240
I stole Nyantaro.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:29.190
I became Sara to connect with Haruka.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:32.140
It wasn't for Haruka. That's a lie.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.750
I, I...

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:39.930
I deceived Haruka to protect myself.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.010
I...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:46.010
<b>I   W a n t   t o   C o n n e c t,</b>

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:46.010
<b>b u t   I   C a n ' t   B e   F o r g i v e n</b>

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.160
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.880
<i>Please</i>

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:56.290
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:02.020
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:07.280
<i>I want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.600
<i>The flickering lightbulb that's been neglected</i>

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.680
<i>One morning, it had quietly died</i>

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:18.020
<i>It's almost like you and me</i>

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.220
<i>Like the fleeting moment when
we held our hands together</i>

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:26.860
<i>I sat with my arms around my knees</i>

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.960
<i>Thinking of the days long gone</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.000
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.720
<i>Please</i>

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:41.220
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:46.700
<i>Even if you aren't here now</i>

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:52.500
<i>Please give me the courage to reach out</i>

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.560
<i>Stand by you</i>

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>Please</i>

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:03.760
<i>I want to get rid of everything</i>

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:16.040
<i>I just want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:25.700
I'm glad the last zombie was so tough.

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:28.360
We can finally leave our post.

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:31.280
Maintenance, again?

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:34.450
It's my lifeline, after all.

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:37.560
I'm not so sure.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:41.500
You really just have a habit 
of chasing pleasure, don't you?

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:41.500
<b>For a kappa,
 a shower...</b>

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:41.500
<b>...makes his
 dish happy</b>

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:43.020
That's foolish.

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:47.010
What's the point of prioritizing 
personal feelings?

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:49.930
You would...

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:53.010
never understand!

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.250
<b>This is a work of fiction.
